{"title":"2022 AMC 10A Problems/Problem 8","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><dl><dd><i>The following problem is from the <a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">2022 AMC 10A #8</a> and <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2022_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_6\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"2022 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 6\">2022 AMC 12A #6</a>, so those problems redirect to this page.</i></dd></dl>\n<div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution_(Casework)\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution (Casework)</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_1_(Quick_and_Simple)\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution 1 (Quick and Simple)</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_2_(Don&#39;t_fall_into_the_trap)\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution 2 (Don't fall into the trap)</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_4\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution 4</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-6\"><a href=\"#See_Also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">6</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See Also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2022_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_8&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>A data set consists of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/0/1/601a7806cbfad68196c43a4665871f8c3186802e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$6$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> (not distinct) positive integers: <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/c/e/dce34f4dfb2406144304ad0d6106c5382ddd1446.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/0/a/e0a0db32027a732ac57d37ef2ae9bb150f65b108.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$7$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/9/0/79069377f91364c2f87a64e5f9f562a091c8a6c1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$5$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/1/c/41c544263a265ff15498ee45f7392c5f86c6d151.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/9/0/79069377f91364c2f87a64e5f9f562a091c8a6c1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$5$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/a/4/6a47ca0fe7cb276abc022af6ac88ddae1a9d6894.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$X$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"18\" height=\"14\" />. The average (arithmetic mean) of the <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/0/1/601a7806cbfad68196c43a4665871f8c3186802e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$6$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> numbers equals a value in the data set. What is the sum of all positive values of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/a/4/6a47ca0fe7cb276abc022af6ac88ddae1a9d6894.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$X$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"18\" height=\"14\" />?\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/7/d/27d00874cbb5f22b04211ee371d6bab7f81182b4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A) } 10 \\qquad \\textbf{(B) } 26 \\qquad \\textbf{(C) } 32 \\qquad \\textbf{(D) } 36 \\qquad \\textbf{(E) } 40$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"401\" height=\"18\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"Solution_.28Casework.29\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_(Casework)\">Solution (Casework)</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2022_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_8&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution (Casework)\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>First, note that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/0/5/d054db5f0b426b3b7f129aeb5a75c6c1ca3e3d0b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1+7+5+2+5=20$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"179\" height=\"15\" />. There are <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/c/d/7cde695f2e4542fd01f860a89189f47a27143b66.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> possible cases:\n</p><p><b>Case 1: the mean is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/9/0/79069377f91364c2f87a64e5f9f562a091c8a6c1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$5$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />.</b>\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/4/c/e4c8bc98d66436c4f6b271166d8e5d47439bba4b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$X = 5 \\cdot 6 - 20 = 10$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"157\" height=\"16\" />.\n</p><p><b>Case 2: the mean is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/0/a/e0a0db32027a732ac57d37ef2ae9bb150f65b108.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$7$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />.</b>\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/8/7/f87e8c49ce1ec5f17810efcaf208f2e1d197d4a9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$X = 7 \\cdot 6 - 20 = 22$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"157\" height=\"16\" />.\n</p><p><b>Case 3: the mean is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/a/4/6a47ca0fe7cb276abc022af6ac88ddae1a9d6894.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$X$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"18\" height=\"14\" />.</b>\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/5/a/d5a2bf27123aeb961b0a6fffe0f479135b9f009a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$X= \\frac{20+X}{6} \\Rightarrow X=4$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"182\" height=\"39\" />.\n</p><p>Therefore, the answer is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/f/4/ff4b254b78f8345ee64321a9534e2ee4005b29b4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$10+22+4=\\boxed{\\textbf{(D) }36}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"181\" height=\"30\" />.\n</p><p>~MrThinker\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"Video_Solution_1_.28Quick_and_Simple.29\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_1_(Quick_and_Simple)\">Video Solution 1 (Quick and Simple)</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2022_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_8&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution 1 (Quick and Simple)\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/8s6SngtEBY4\">https://youtu.be/8s6SngtEBY4</a>\n</p><p>~Education, the Study of Everything\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"Video_Solution_2_.28Don.27t_fall_into_the_trap.29\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_2_(Don't_fall_into_the_trap)\">Video Solution 2 (Don't fall into the trap)</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2022_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_8&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution 2 (Don&#39;t fall into the trap)\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/7yAh4MtJ8a8?si=r_qxJ_xhfngz4Xu6&amp;t=1143\">https://youtu.be/7yAh4MtJ8a8?si=r_qxJ_xhfngz4Xu6&amp;t=1143</a>\n</p><p>~Math-X\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_4\">Video Solution 4</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2022_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_8&amp;action=edit&amp;section=5\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution 4\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/35cuytqS9iw\">https://youtu.be/35cuytqS9iw</a>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2022_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_8&amp;action=edit&amp;section=6\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2022_AMC_10A\" title=\"2022 AMC 10A\">2022 AMC 10A</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2022_AMC_10A_Problems\" title=\"2022 AMC 10A Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2022_AMC_10A_Answer_Key\" title=\"2022 AMC 10A Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/community/c13\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2022_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_7\" title=\"2022 AMC 10A Problems/Problem 7\">Problem 7</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?t